                    <p>
                        Maintain personal information, photographs and
                        important student details in one record.
                    </p>
                </div>


                <div class="edu-student-feature">
                    <div class="edu-student-icon">👨‍👩‍👦</div>

                    <h3>Guardian Information</h3>

                    <p>
                        Keep parent and guardian contact details linked
                        to each student record.
                    </p>
                </div>


                <div class="edu-student-feature">
                    <div class="edu-student-icon">🏫</div>

                    <h3>Class Assignment</h3>

                    <p>
                        Assign students to classes and sections and keep
                        assignments up to date.
                    </p>
                </div>


                <div class="edu-student-feature">
                    <div class="edu-student-icon">📋</div>

                    <h3>Enrollment History</h3>

                    <p>
                        Track enrollment dates, promotions and academic
                        year history for every student.
                    </p>
                </div>


                <div class="edu-student-feature">
                    <div class="edu-student-icon">📚</div>

                    <h3>Academic Records</h3>

                    <p>
                        Connect student records with attendance, exams
                        and academic performance.
                    </p>
                </div>


                <div class="edu-student-feature">
                    <div class="edu-student-icon">📁</div>

                    <h3>Document Storage</h3>

                    <p>
                        Keep important student documents organized and
                        accessible when needed.
                    </p>
                </div>

            </div>

        </div>

    </section>


    <!-- LIFECYCLE -->
    <section class="edu-student-section edu-student-light">

        <div class="edu-student-container">

            <div class="edu-student-heading">

                <span>Student Lifecycle</span>

                <h2>
                    From Enrollment to Graduation
                </h2>

                <p>
                    Follow a student's complete journey through the
                    school in a clear, connected workflow.
                </p>

            </div>


